{"id":"a6113a3bfb6f9c65","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-tree11-bounded-branch-set.md","title":"ZFC Tree11 Bounded Branch Set","display":"df-zfc-tree11-bounded-branch-set — ZFC Tree11 Bounded Branch Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-tree11-bounded-branch-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-tree11-bounded-branch-set"],"display":"df-zfc-tree11-bounded-branch-set — ZFC Tree11 Bounded Branch Set","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-tree10-branch-through-tree.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-tree11-bounded-branch-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-tree11-bounded-branch-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-tree11-bounded-branch-set — ZFC Tree11 Bounded Branch Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4e2db324148413bc\" href=\"?note=4e2db324148413bc\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-zfc-tree10-branch-through-tree.md\">../batch06/58-df-zfc-tree10-branch-through-tree.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> (set of branches)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (tree)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> (ordinal bound, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> (ordinal predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree10BranchThroughTree}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree10BranchThroughTree}_S\\)</span> (branch predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4e2db324148413bc\" href=\"?note=4e2db324148413bc\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-zfc-tree10-branch-through-tree.md\">../batch06/58-df-zfc-tree10-branch-through-tree.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate used to type sequence nodes)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree11BoundedBranchSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree11BoundedBranchSet}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree11\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}branch\\text{-}set}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcTree11BoundedBranchSet}_S(B,T,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land(\\forall t\\in T\\;\\exists\\beta\\in\\alpha\\;\\exists Y\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Function}(t,\\beta,Y))\\land\\forall b\\;\\left(b\\in B\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcTree10BranchThroughTree}_S(b,T)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree11\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}branch\\text{-}set}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcTree11BoundedBranchSet}_S(B,T,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land(\\forall t\\in T\\;\\exists\\beta\\in\\alpha\\;\\exists Y\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Function}(t,\\beta,Y))\\land\\forall b\\;\\left(b\\in B\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcTree10BranchThroughTree}_S(b,T)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The ambient tree is now explicitly required to consist of sequence nodes of length below <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>; only then is the branch set defined by the upstream branch predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-zfc-tree10-branch-through-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"4e2db324148413bc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-tree10-branch-through-tree.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\alpha$ (ordinal bound, see [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-zfc-tree10-branch-through-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"4e2db324148413bc","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTree10BranchThroughTree}_S$ (branch predicate, see [[../batch06/58-df-zfc-tree10-branch-through-tree.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree10BranchThroughTree}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree11BoundedBranchSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree11\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}branch\\text{-}set}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcTree11BoundedBranchSet}_S(B,T,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land(\\forall t\\in T\\;\\exists\\beta\\in\\alpha\\;\\exists Y\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Function}(t,\\beta,Y))\\land\\forall b\\;\\left(b\\in B\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcTree10BranchThroughTree}_S(b,T)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false}],"bytes":1444,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3785","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-tree11-bounded-branch-set.md|58-df-zfc-tree11-bounded-branch-set]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","5582a281f15a33c2","4e2db324148413bc","36d7463d215be751"]}